#Research Project
## Chosen Topic :
AI-powered SEO content production

## Objective
This research project explores how leading B2B SaaS marketers use AI to improve SEO content production while maintaining quality and search performance. By studying experienced practitioners and their recent content, the goal is to build a structured knowledge base of proven strategies, workflows, and best practices that can be used to develop a practical SEO content playbook.

