He continues to practice and test this thinking publicly via the Contrarian Marketing podcast, where he and Kevin Indig regularly debate live predictions about AI search shifts (e.g., SGE, AI Overviews) rather than presenting settled conclusions — a level of transparency about being wrong or uncertain that's uncommon in the space.

