- **Date:** February 10, 2026
- **Link:** https://open.spotify.com/episode/1WKGHkBXc039k4TlPwGK8B
- **Summary:** Schwartz challenges the assumption that major AI platform partnerships (e.g., Apple-Gemini) signal the death of SEO, arguing instead that they reinforce Google's continued dominance over search for the near future, while search surfaces themselves keep expanding into new devices and contexts.
