## Overall Themes
Crestodina's recurring themes are rigor and proof: he consistently backs claims with original survey data (Orbit's annual blogger and B2B marketing surveys are cited industry-wide), documents his own agency's results transparently, and frames content marketing as a long-game relationship-building discipline rather than a short-term traffic play. His content increasingly incorporates AI workflow guidance (e.g., prompt frameworks for content specificity) while maintaining his consistent emphasis on measurable, business-tied outcomes.

